{"seq":3,"slug":"market-dynamics","title":"市场动态与价格机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crypto-market-microstructure","title":"加密市场微观结构","url":"/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/crypto-market-microstructure","wordCount":1775,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"stablecoin-mechanism-design","title":"稳定币机制设计","url":"/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/stablecoin-mechanism-design","wordCount":1800,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"derivatives-perpetuals","title":"加密衍生品与永续合约","url":"/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/derivatives-perpetuals","wordCount":1523,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 市场动态与价格机制\n\n加密资产市场的微观结构与传统金融市场存在结构性差异：7×24 小时无间断交易、碎片化的流动性分布在数十个交易所、缺乏统一的最佳执行义务、以及链上与链下订单流的交互。本章从市场微观结构理论出发，分析加密市场的价格发现机制、稳定币的锚定维持策略、以及永续合约作为杠杆工具的经济学。\n\n三篇文档分别覆盖：市场微观结构（订单簿深度、价差形成、跨交易所套利）、稳定币机制设计（算法型 vs 超额抵押型 vs 法币储备型的三元不可能）、以及加密衍生品的 funding rate 均衡与基差交易策略。\n"}